{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 3384,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This propeller craft was built to\nsettle a physics debate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3384,
    "dDurationMs": 4972,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because what its creators claim it can do is so\ncounterintuitive"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8356,
    "dDurationMs": 4274,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it seems to violate the law of conservation of energy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12630,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I've come here to drive it\nmyself and see if it really works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17910,
    "dDurationMs": 2949,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And is it safe? It feels makeshift.\nI'm not gonna lie."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20859,
    "dDurationMs": 1341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I need some wind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22200,
    "dDurationMs": 4082,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Give me a gust. It's a\nlittle unbalanced. Isn't it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30510,
    "dDurationMs": 1622,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Slow it down, Derek!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32827,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pull tack, pull tack!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36470,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This video was sponsored by Kiwico,\nmore about them at the end of the show."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44420,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've come to El Mirage, a dry lakebed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47151,
    "dDurationMs": 4499,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a couple hours from Los Angeles to\nrace a one of a kind propeller craft."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54380,
    "dDurationMs": 1963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's called Blackbird."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56343,
    "dDurationMs": 1635,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm here with its inventor, Rick"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57978,
    "dDurationMs": 1031,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Howdy!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59180,
    "dDurationMs": 2094,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the current owner, Neil."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62300,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It all started with a brain teaser:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64550,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can any wind-powered\nvehicle go directly downwind"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69020,
    "dDurationMs": 2023,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "faster than the wind itself?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72560,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you've got a sail boat and you're\nsailing it straight down, wind. - Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75920,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As soon as that sailboat is\ngoing the same speed as the wind,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79280,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then there is no more wind. That is\ncorrect. You can't push the sailboat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82220,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So sailboats can't just go\ndownwind faster than the wind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85850,
    "dDurationMs": 1416,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not straight downwind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87266,
    "dDurationMs": 1264,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Not straight downwind? Not direct downwind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89360,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Imagine a boat floating in the water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92420,
    "dDurationMs": 4127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As the wind picks up, it pushes\nthe sail, accelerating the boat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96770,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The boat gets faster and\nfaster until its speed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100341,
    "dDurationMs": 3539,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "exactly matches the\nwind. But at this point,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104000,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the wind can't push the\nsail anymore. I mean,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106551,
    "dDurationMs": 2279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you imagine it from the\nframe of reference of the boat,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109160,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's no longer any apparent wind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111440,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's no air moving over the boat\nbecause the air and the boat are moving"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115551,
    "dDurationMs": 2129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "together at the same speed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117680,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So a sailboat going directly\ndownwind can only match the speed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122601,
    "dDurationMs": 4049,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the wind, never exceed\nit, even if there's no drag."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127340,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the claim is Blackbird can do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130340,
    "dDurationMs": 5723,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It can go straight downwind faster\nthan the air that is pushing it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137510,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well the weather forecast is\nstill holding. Okay, good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140420,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can feel it's at like one now. Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142970,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But El Mirage has a reputation of like\nwhen it fills in... Yeah, it happens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147050,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It happens. I think we start somewhere\nin the middle. All right. Well, let's,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151410,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "let's move over."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153830,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're moving to a spot\nthat will give us a long,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155901,
    "dDurationMs": 3209,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "straight path downwind with no obstacles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159590,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All we need now is for the wind to\npick up and maintain its direction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165170,
    "dDurationMs": 4710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But we've been out here in the\nhot desert for hours and there is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169881,
    "dDurationMs": 1439,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "still no wind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176630,
    "dDurationMs": 3770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is Gene. He runs\nthe YouTube channel Potato Jet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180850,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All the awesome drone shots\nin this video are his."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183700,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you like cameras and\ngear and amazing drone shots,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187240,
    "dDurationMs": 1766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "go check out his channel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191460,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is, this is about a\ntypical day. How it goes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195990,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek, I think the wind is\njust chosen its direction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198331,
    "dDurationMs": 3029,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to move us to the\nother side. We'll set up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201360,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We'll point downwind over in\nthis direction. We'll put you in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204780,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's make it happen!\nYes. I want to do it!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213114,
    "dDurationMs": 3873,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your feet need to go a long way\ndown. So it'll feel really recumbant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216987,
    "dDurationMs": 3753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So maybe I need to... Keep going.\nShould I get something behind me? Yup!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221160,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm very reclined. Yeah.\nLet me see what I can find."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223080,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's slightly terrifying to, uh,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226710,
    "dDurationMs": 2483,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not be able to push the brake all the way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229800,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you're kind of right\nat the limit of size."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232230,
    "dDurationMs": 2947,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. You wouldn't want to be any\nsmaller."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235177,
    "dDurationMs": 3678,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Uh, so steering is I... - Push to go left,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238855,
    "dDurationMs": 3005,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Push to go left. -Pull to go right. -Pull to go right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241860,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While steering with my right hand,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243750,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have to control the pitch\nof the propeller blades."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246330,
    "dDurationMs": 1508,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With my left hand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247838,
    "dDurationMs": 1642,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then in terms of like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249481,
    "dDurationMs": 2699,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when I'm getting to the end or something\nwhere I really want to slow down,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252180,
    "dDurationMs": 3226,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the right move is pull back?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255406,
    "dDurationMs": 2119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're saying the right move is push forward?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257730,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm glad that the two experts here\nare disagreeing on what to do in the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261901,
    "dDurationMs": 2159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "emergency case of like, I\njust want to stop the vehicle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265148,
    "dDurationMs": 2316,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Feel which is slowing you down\nand do that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267464,
    "dDurationMs": 1385,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[nervous laughter]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269130,
    "dDurationMs": 2791,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's just terrifying not to have\na, a blanket rule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271921,
    "dDurationMs": 2613,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, uh, this is intense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274980,
    "dDurationMs": 4770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have never tried to go faster than\nthe wind downwind in a vehicle where I'm"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279751,
    "dDurationMs": 3419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just supported by this\nmesh hammock under my butt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283170,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It feels like being in a rolling coffin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287280,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's just been uh shoddily put\ntogether, but I'm excited to try it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291630,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm excited to survive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297690,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can look at that\norange string right there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299820,
    "dDurationMs": 5110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's showing that the wind is picking\nup behind me. This is what I need."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305550,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the front of Blackbird, there's a,\ntelltale, a little piece of string,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309690,
    "dDurationMs": 2137,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which shows which way the wind is\nblowing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311827,
    "dDurationMs": 1913,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To drive straight downwind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313740,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just need to follow the telltale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315630,
    "dDurationMs": 2707,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it should be pointing\nstraight out in front."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318894,
    "dDurationMs": 1776,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, if I get up to wind speed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320700,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the telltale should drop straight down\nbecause effectively I'll be in still"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325381,
    "dDurationMs": 3479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "air. I'll be moving exactly\nthe same speed as the wind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333510,
    "dDurationMs": 2234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All right, good luck Derek!\n- Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335744,
    "dDurationMs": 1216,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I hope I survive this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339630,
    "dDurationMs": 2548,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Come on, come on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342178,
    "dDurationMs": 2312,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I need some wind. Give me a gust."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 345390,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, if I can actually\ngo faster than the wind,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347730,
    "dDurationMs": 4667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the telltale should flip around and point\nstraight at me, indicating that I have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352397,
    "dDurationMs": 1963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an apparent headwind,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354360,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even though the true wind, standing\non the ground, is coming from behind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359480,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're going straight downwind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361430,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What have I got? Six miles an hour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366290,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The string is just dangling. You\nsee the string dangling there? Oh,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369771,
    "dDurationMs": 3689,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just need a gust right here. I just\nneed a bit of wind. That's all I need."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374570,
    "dDurationMs": 2665,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I will, uh, hop on the brakes\nhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377235,
    "dDurationMs": 1475,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Man, we were so close."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379760,
    "dDurationMs": 4487,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, I saw that string\ndangling down. I was like, okay,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384247,
    "dDurationMs": 1483,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is it. Let's keep going."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385730,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then unfortunately. At one point it was\ndangling and I asked, what speed are we?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389330,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he said, we're five or six\nmiles an hour. And I'm like damn."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391220,
    "dDurationMs": 2690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cause he's almost exactly wind speed.\nYep. Five or six miles an hour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393940,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just not enough to get you -\nright - past there. I needed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396860,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just like that extra few."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398930,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Miles an hour. 8's kinda the absolute\nminimum, 10 is pretty healthy. Yeah. Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403370,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, I can't wait."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405680,
    "dDurationMs": 3710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now you might be wondering how it's even\ntheoretically possible for this vehicle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409391,
    "dDurationMs": 3869,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to go faster than the wind\nwill. Well sailboats can do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413410,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As long as they're traveling at some\nangle to the wind. In this case,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417640,
    "dDurationMs": 4650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the sail acts like a wing air flows\nfaster over the outer curved surface than"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422291,
    "dDurationMs": 4949,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the inner side, which generates lift a\nforce perpendicular to the apparent wind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427660,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A component of this lift force\nis in the forward direction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430750,
    "dDurationMs": 4410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So maximum speed is reached when this\nforward force is equal to all the drag"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435161,
    "dDurationMs": 2069,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "forces on the boat, pushing it backwards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437710,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some boats can go three\nor four times wind speed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441550,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Somebody had asked the question. If\na sailboat is tacking down, wind,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445540,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can it do a VMG velocity made good\ndirectly downwind? Can it beat - if I,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449231,
    "dDurationMs": 1679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if I release a balloon in the air,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451330,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can the sailboat tack its way down and\nbeat the balloon to its destination?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455260,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I didn't know the answer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456880,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It turns out that sailing\nat some angle to the wind,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 460030,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a sailboat can go enough faster that\nit's resulting velocity directly downwind"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465280,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is faster than the wind\nitself. In other words,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468700,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it can beat a balloon that\nis just drifting on the wind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473710,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I love brainteasers. I just\nlove doing brainteaser."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 475820,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I thought this is really close to a\ngood brain teaser, but it's right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 479561,
    "dDurationMs": 1019,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's just a question though."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480610,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If we make it go straight downwind and\nthen people were definitely going to say"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 484361,
    "dDurationMs": 3569,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "no. If the earth were a cylinder,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488350,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "instead of a sphere, I can have a\nsailboat on a continuous downwind tack."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492760,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The wind is going along the\nearth, this cylindrical earth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496180,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the sailboat is just\nspiraling its way down. - Hmm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 499870,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I put two sailboats, one on\neither side, they can both do this..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 505660,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well. That's a prop. Effectively"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509500,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their sales make a propeller,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513130,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a propeller that is traveling down\nthis earth faster than the wind itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519910,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was, I posted on two\nforums that I was on. Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522190,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I thought people are initially going\nto go, no, never work. And then I say,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525941,
    "dDurationMs": 3939,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "okay, here's how it works. And they\ngo oh, [bleep] you got us. Boy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529900,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I couldn't have possibly been more wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532270,
    "dDurationMs": 4670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is, obviously, stupid.\nWind isn't some kind of magic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537330,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We all want to believe\nin perpetual motion,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539611,
    "dDurationMs": 3959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I just don't see the logic\nof this argument as yet. Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543571,
    "dDurationMs": 4199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is clearly fake. Anyone with\na clue should see the problem here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 548190,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Once you reach wind speed,\nwhat powers it past that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551370,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am not a stupid person,\nbut I cannot understand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556820,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ultimately we said, okay,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 557751,
    "dDurationMs": 4229,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if we build a little model of one and put\nit on a treadmill that just puts it to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561981,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bed. Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564200,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it worked really well. Now you,\nyou're holding it back with this spork?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567470,
    "dDurationMs": 544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "otherwise it'll climb right\nup the top of the treadmill."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568014,
    "dDurationMs": 5426,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah I'm keeping it from coming forward,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573440,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But people on the internet just wouldn't\nbelieve him. They thought it was fake."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 578030,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And even physics professors were arguing\nthat the treadmill wasn't a good analog"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581781,
    "dDurationMs": 4649,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the real world. And I'm like literally\nday one, physics is inertial frames,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 586431,
    "dDurationMs": 2309,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right? It doesn't matter if you're\nmoving or the air is moving."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 588830,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The others were saying there's\nmagnets, there's wires."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 591350,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you go there's fans out of view.\nSo then we do one showing, you know,"
