  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598190,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we got to build the real thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605150,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay. We are cooking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607340,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see we're going seven, seven\nmiles an hour, eight miles an hour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 617660,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Come on. You got it. Come on. Uh oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626450,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm very sad about this propeller."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 629270,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'm guessing this means the\nchain has come off. How did it feel?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 633020,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was a lot of fun. I could feel us\npicking up speed. I could see it spinning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636891,
    "dDurationMs": 3119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I could see that we got up to like\neight miles an hour, nine miles an hour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640011,
    "dDurationMs": 1979,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was like, oh, we're\njust going to do it. You know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642560,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then all of a sudden I\nstill felt like I was going,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 645411,
    "dDurationMs": 2609,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I noticed that the prop wasn't\nspinning, and I thought, oh,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648021,
    "dDurationMs": 4799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's a terrible sign. So, uh, yeah.\nThen we had to stop and fix the,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653060,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fix the chain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655130,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When in doubt use a bigger wrench."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658220,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here's the thing about this\nvehicle. It's not what it looks like."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662660,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What you imagine. I bet is that when\nthe wind blows on that propeller,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667430,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it spins the way the wind is pushing\nit. And that drives the wheels."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671420,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that's actually not how this works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674510,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The way it works is the\nwind pushes it from behind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677660,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And just because it's a bluff body,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680031,
    "dDurationMs": 2189,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's just an object\nsitting out in the desert."
