  }, {
    "tStartMs": 741270,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but something is definitely wrong.\nJust look at that propelorl."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 745051,
    "dDurationMs": 1409,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It' a little unbalanced, isn't\nit? Pull the pitch! Good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753720,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what's the game plan?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 755390,
    "dDurationMs": 4390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you feel excessive vibration. I think\nwe got to pull the trigger on it. Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 760650,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I want to go right out and say: I\ndon't think I would drive it in this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 767350,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wind. I will, if you would\nlike me to. I mean, I will,"
