  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770860,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I will given the opportunity,\nbut I'm more than hap..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773841,
    "dDurationMs": 3219,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't come here to drive. So\nyou drive it. If you want to do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 780640,
    "dDurationMs": 2630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you were going to decide\nabout getting in like it there a."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 783270,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is there a point where you\nsay that's too much? Um,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786180,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for today and the way\nthings are? 15 ish. Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 788881,
    "dDurationMs": 4349,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So 15ish is what we were measuring like\nearlier. What are you seeing now? Ehh..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794070,
    "dDurationMs": 480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That feels like."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794550,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "15 To me. Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 796470,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've been out there for several hours\nand first it was just waiting to go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 801480,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now it's like, it's broken\nand now I was like, we can go,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 805530,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it might shake itself apart.\nAnd the wind is on the high end."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810180,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is sketchy for sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 819230,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh God. Did"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 823290,
    "dDurationMs": 4050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We get that on camera?\nDid you? I did, Oh no!"
