  }, {
    "tStartMs": 839251,
    "dDurationMs": 2189,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "terms of the shake, the wobble."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 841441,
    "dDurationMs": 4859,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they're worried that it's gonna\nlike break in half the whole structural"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 846301,
    "dDurationMs": 2729,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "component and the whole propeller is\ngoing to come down on whoever's driving."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 849780,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they're a little bit, um,\nreticent to let me keep driving."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 853500,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the guy who basically built it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 856560,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he's going to risk himself\nin the driver's seat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 859680,
    "dDurationMs": 2890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then if it's not shaking itself apart,\nthen maybe I get another shot after."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 862620,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's a, that's the word"
