  }, {
    "tStartMs": 888030,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I do. I really do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 890760,
    "dDurationMs": 3350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it means that you will have\nnearly a guaranteed success,"
