      "utf8": "It looks like we're coming\nup on wind speed here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 962740,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Blackbird is getting faster and faster."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 967210,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm just willing it to\ngo past the wind speed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 970720,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Come on, come on, come on.\nSpeed up, speed up with me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 991180,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Come on, yeah. Wooooo!\nYeah.... And there you have it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 992680,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The telltale is pointing straight back\nat me showing an apparent headwind while"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 997481,
    "dDurationMs": 3779,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the windsock shows the true wind\nis in the opposite direction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1001710,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm going faster than the wind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1004440,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Slow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1009440,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it\ndown\nDerek.\nPull\ntack,\npull\ntack!\nOooh,\nthat\nwas..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1033660,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "God damn that got my heart rate up.\nSacred the [beep] out of us Derek. -Did"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1038521,
    "dDurationMs": 1859,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that look scary? Cause\nit didn't feel too bad."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1044100,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So how does it actually work? Well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1047760,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I worked on this video for weeks without\nreally understanding how it works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1052170,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I want to share with you\nthe way that I understand it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1056700,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if this vehicle is moving\nat the speed of the wind well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1060901,
    "dDurationMs": 4349,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then there's no relative\nair motion over the cart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1065370,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So how can it keep accelerating?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1067500,
    "dDurationMs": 4670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If this were like a windmill that required\nair to flow over it in order to turn"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1072500,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well, then it wouldn't accelerate\nanymore, but that's not how this operates."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1076940,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This propeller operates as a fan, which\nmeans if you imagine this still air,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1082370,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the propeller can come down and\nhit some of these air molecules,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1086031,
    "dDurationMs": 3119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pushing them backwards\nand therefore get thrust."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1089180,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like having a fan on your cart.\nSo of course even in still air,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1093261,
    "dDurationMs": 2519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "having a fan on the cart\nwill blow you forwards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1096410,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that brings up this idea of it feels\nlike we're getting energy from nowhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1100790,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Where's the energy to power the fan coming\nfrom? If it's coming from the wheels,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1105050,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why doesn't that slow us down more\nthan the fan manages to blow us back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1110510,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the answer to that is that you're\nmoving at a different speed over the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1114650,
    "dDurationMs": 4410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ground. than you're moving through the\nair because you have that tailwind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1119780,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the way I like to\nimagine it is like this:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1122660,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's air everywhere going 10\nkilometers per hour down that way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1128000,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, even if we're going\n10 kilometers per hour,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1131150,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we can still push air backwards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1134120,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so if you were to look at a profile\nof the air in a stationary reference"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1138351,
    "dDurationMs": 4559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "point, you would see that the wind\nbehind the propeller would be moving more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1142911,
    "dDurationMs": 2939,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "slowly downwind than all the other wind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1145851,
    "dDurationMs": 4679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's because this propeller has\ntaken some of the energy out of that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1150531,
    "dDurationMs": 3749,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wind and converted it into the\nkinetic energy of this cart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1154940,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So behind the propeller, there would\nbe, say, eight kilometer per hour,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1159380,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wind and everywhere else, there\nwould be 10 kilometer per hour wind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1163730,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the energy from this wind behind\nthe propeller has gone into the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1168591,
    "dDurationMs": 2369,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cart into accelerating it forwards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1171140,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it is moving forward\nfaster than the wind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1175310,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even when this is moving\nforward, faster than wind speed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1178190,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the propeller can still\npush the air backwards,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1181310,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "slowing down that tailwind and\ntaking some of that wind's energy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1186020,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "converting it into the kinetic\nenergy of this vehicle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1190130,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now the people who made Blackbird\nmanaged to get a record,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1193550,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they got up to 2.8 times the wind speed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1197510,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it is obvious to me from all of the\ndemonstrations and from riding in the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1201861,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "vehicle myself, that this\nis physically possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1205820,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is a way to drive a vehicle that\ngoes downwind faster than the wind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1210500,
    "dDurationMs": 4650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I know it is so counterintuitive\nthat I expect a lot of pushback in the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1215151,
    "dDurationMs": 3149,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "comments. My only request\nis please be civil."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1230770,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hey, this video was sponsored by Kiwico\na company that makes awesome hands-on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1234791,
    "dDurationMs": 1139,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "projects for kids."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1236200,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now the big idea is that while playing\nand having fun kids learn about STEAM"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1240221,
    "dDurationMs": 4169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "concepts, that is science, technology,\nengineering, art, and math."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1244750,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I pull out a crate, my kids\njump at chance to make it with me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1248640,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what's really handy is that all the\nmaterials you need come right in the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1252331,
    "dDurationMs": 4709,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "box. And that means no running out to\nthe store. You just open it up and go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1257310,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now in this one, we learned about\naerodynamics like lift and drag."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1261300,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in addition to the project,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1262591,
    "dDurationMs": 2789,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's a magazine with\nlots of additional content."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1265770,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now I think this is the best way to learn,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1267991,
    "dDurationMs": 2639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by doing something\nyourself and having fun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1270960,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is how education\nreally should be. Now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1273751,
    "dDurationMs": 3299,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kiwico has eight subscription\nlines targeted at different\nage groups all the way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1277051,
    "dDurationMs": 3539,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "down to newborns. So if you want to try\nit out, go to Kiwico.com/veritasium50"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1283170,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you'll get 50% off your\nfirst month of any crate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1286530,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now I will put that link\ndown in the description."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1288840,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I want to thank Kiwico for sponsoring\nVeritasium and I want to thank you for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1292770,
    "dDurationMs": 3470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "watching. Stop it? You\ncan push the button now."
    } ]
  } ]
}
